            "title_desktop_size": 1.5,
            "title_mobile_size": 2.1,
            "title_color": "#b68b32",
            "content": "<p>In collaboration with renown blacksmith (and workshop neighbor) Robert Thomas, Smithey expanded into producing carbon steel cookware in 2018 with our farmhouse collection. Each piece of the farmhouse collection is individually hand-forged and visually unique, while sharing core design features tuned to the Smithey style. The resulting cookware is as beautiful as it is functional.</p>",
