            "title_desktop_size": 1.5,
            "title_mobile_size": 2.1,
            "title_color": "#b68b32",
            "content": "<p>We are proud of what we make. We design and craft our cookware in the USA, and our talented team of craftsmen and women individually inspects every Smithey multiple times throughout our manufacturing process. We guarantee the quality of every Smithey for life. We intend for your Smithey to become a cherished possession, and we are here to support you in your cooking journey. Use it well.</p>",
